OL,3,GNEWSACampaign aims to stop teens
OL,4,Asharing intimate images
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new campaign has been launched by
OL,7,Fpolice encouraging young people to stop
OL,8,Fand think before sharing an intimate
OL,9,Fphoto with someone else.
OL,11,FThe Sussex Police campaign, called
OL,12,FThink Twice, encourages teenagers to
OL,13,Fpause before pressing send, reminding
OL,14,Fthem they will no longer have control
OL,15,Fonce the image has been shared.
OL,17,FThe force said the scheme was aiming to
OL,18,Feducate, rather than prosecute, but it
OL,19,Fdid remind people it is illegal for
OL,20,Fanyone to make, share, send or receive
OL,21,Fan image of a person under 18 years
OL,22,Fold.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
